AudioCool downloads, on first use, the NVIDIA Parakeet unified en 0.6B speech model
(converted for sherpa-onnx). Licensed by NVIDIA Corporation under the NVIDIA Open Model License:
https://www.nvidia.com/en-us/agreements/enterprise-software/nvidia-open-model-license/

The app bundles the Silero VAD model (MIT, https://github.com/snakers4/silero-vad) and the GTCRN
speech enhancement model (MIT, https://github.com/Xiaobin-Rong/gtcrn), and is built with
sherpa-onnx (Apache-2.0, https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx).
